[center][img]https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ReidenXerx/fo4-rapport@79c928255c6aee7b2b2b3b6a6f69c18a31ae978f/docs/img/hero.jpg[/img][/center]

[center][size=4][b]An F4SE framework for AAF. It runs the scene: the two people talk to each other, bystanders notice, faces follow the act, and everyone remembers who they were with.[/b][/size][/center]

[center]
